<title>BRAZIL: Brazil aluminium output up one percent in May.</title>
<headline>Brazil aluminium output up one percent in May.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian production of primary aluminium totalled 102,000 tonnes in May, one percent up on the 101,000 tonnes produced in May 1996, the Brazilian Aluminium Association (ABAL) said in a statement.</p>
<p>Production in the first five months of this year is marginally down on last year however, reaching 493,200 tonnes, down 0.6 percent on the 496,000 tonnes produced in January/May 1996.</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
